        "bodyHtml": "Graves fires a powder round dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(50/75/100/125/150 + (55% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. After 1 second or after colliding with terrain, it detonates, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(80/125/170/215/260 + (45/60/75/90/105% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> along the travel path again and to enemies near the blast.",
