        "name": "Collateral Damage",
        "summary": "Graves fires an explosive shell dealing heavy damage to the first champion it hits. After hitting a champion or reaching the end of its range, the shell explodes dealing damage in a cone.",
        "bodyHtml": "Graves fires an explosive cartridge, blasting himself backwards. The cartridge deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(275/425/575 + (150% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to the first enemy hit. After hitting an enemy champion or reaching the end of its range, the cartridge explodes outward, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(200/320/440 + (120% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>.",
